  lex_identifiers_err_char.pcpp - Lexical: a character no token starts with

  Break step of lex_identifiers: a backquote starts no PaskalCPP or C++
  token, LX0004. (A byte that is not UTF-8 is LX0011; a test file must be
  UTF-8 to be scanned, so that one is the lex area's code test
  lex.utf8_invalid.)
